  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FARMS - Facility for Refugees, Migrants, Forced Displacement and Rural S</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to contribute to sustainable food and nutrition security and resilience to crises of rural households in the specific region in Niger. The target group include several thousand refugees, displaced and returnees in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
